
{ box-sizing: border-box; } body { margin: 0; padding: 20px; background: #0b1020; color: #ffffff; font-family: Arial, sans-serif; } .container { max-width: 600px; margin: 35px auto; padding: 24px; background: #151d33; border: 1px solid #293653; border-radius: 18px;} h1 { color: #55e6a5; text-align: center; font-size: 28px;} .subtitle { text-align: center; color: #c5cee0; line-height: 1.6;} label { display:block; margin: 22px 0 10px; font-weight:bold;} select, textarea { width:100%; padding: 13px; border: 1px solid #465674; border-radius: 10px; background: #0b1020; color: white; font-size:16px;} textarea { min-height: 115px; resize: vertical;} button { width: 100%; padding: 14px; margin-top: 16px; border: none; border-radius: 10px; background: #55e6a5; color: #07150f; font-size: 16px; font-weight: bold; cursor: pointer;} #result { display:none; margin-top: 22px; padding: 16px; border-radius: 12px; background: #0b1020; border-left: 4px solid #55e6a5;} .note { margin-top: 22px; color: #aebbd2; font-size: 13px; }    main containerAI BGMI Problem Finder  Find possible solutions to your BGMI problems. Describe your issue and get troubleshooting steps. label for="problem">Select Your Problem select id="problem"> option value="general"> Other Problem </option option value="fps">FPS Drop / Stuttering </option option value="fo>
